    "detailed_description": "<strong>Radiant Bricks</strong> is a classic Brick Breaker Style game with a twist. You can change the color of the paddles, hitting the ball with the paddle will change the color of the ball. You can only destroy bricks that are the same color as the ball.<br><br>You also have a paddle on both sides of the bricks. Some strategy will help you create<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Select a primary and secondary color to make the bricks your preferred colors. </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Play solo or with a friend locally. Let another player take control of the second paddle. </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Multiple power ups that do things like increase the score, give you a bigger paddle or even add an extra wall! </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Pixel Art Style Graphics </ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Level Creator </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Local Co-op mode </ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Radiant Bricks</strong> is a classic Brick Breaker Style game with a twist. You can change the color of the paddles, hitting the ball with the paddle will change the color of the ball. You can only destroy bricks that are the same color as the ball.<br><br>You also have a paddle on both sides of the bricks. Some strategy will help you create<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Select a primary and secondary color to make the bricks your preferred colors. </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Play solo or with a friend locally. Let another player take control of the second paddle. </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Multiple power ups that do things like increase the score, give you a bigger paddle or even add an extra wall! </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Pixel Art Style Graphics </ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Level Creator </ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">* Local Co-op mode </ul>",
    "short_description": "Classic brick breaker with a twist. Change the color of the paddles to change which bricks you can hit. Part action, part puzzle.",
